# EvANotes: Phase 1 Foundation Walkthrough

We have successfully transitioned from branding to the implementation phase. The application now features a fully functional foundation built with React and Vite, strictly adhering to the "Core Indigo" design system.

## Key Accomplishments

### 1. Functional Foundation
- **Project Scaffolding:** Resolved initialization issues to establish a clean, robust React+Vite project.
- **Design Tokens:** Implemented the full [index.css](file:///C:/projects/Evanotes/EvANotesApp/src/index.css) system with glassmorphism utilities and CSS variables.
- **Dynamic Entry Points:** Configured [main.jsx](file:///C:/projects/Evanotes/EvANotesApp/src/main.jsx) and [App.jsx](file:///C:/projects/Evanotes/EvANotesApp/src/App.jsx) for a smooth React mounting process.

### 2. Branding Integration
- **Monogram Logo:** Integrated the "Soft Monogram" (EvA) as a reusable React component with live SVGs.
- **Favicon:** The custom "Soft Monogram" favicon is correctly appearing in the browser tab.

### 3. High-Fidelity App Shell
- **Glassmorphic Header:** A premium sticky header featuring the brand logo and profile navigation.
- **Stat Dashboard:** Three interactive, glass-style cards for tracking productivity metrics.
- **Task List UI:** An elegant, brand-compliant task list with custom checkbox states.

