## Verification Results
- [x] **React Mounting:** Verified via live browser subagent.
- [x] **Branding Colors:** Confirmed background `#0b1120` and gradients.
- [x] **Typography:** Confirmed "Outfit" for headings and "Inter" for UI.

Next, we will proceed to Phase 2 to build out the full "Core Components" and persistent storage logic.
